"This is a valid {platform_name} certificate for {user_name}, who participated in {partner_short_name} "
"{course_number}"
msgstr ""
"Il s'agit d'un certificat {platform_name} valide pour {user_name}, qui a participé à {partner_short_name} "
"{course_number}"

